  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Finishing a Reload restores health based on the number of hits scored with the weapon before reloading.\n\nScoring 100% of the Magazine as hits restores 50 HP. No known upper limit to the total amount.\n\nGlaive Melee Hits don't count. Grenade Launcher hits each count as 50% of the Magazine.",
